Package: chonkos-desktop
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Oliwier-w <oliwier-w@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: chonkos-core (= {{VERSION}}), sway, swaybg, swaylock, swayidle, kanshi, wlr-randr, waybar, foot, fuzzel, mako-notifier, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, brightnessctl, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, pipewire-audio, greetd, tuigreet, fonts-jetbrains-mono
Conflicts: chonkos-desktop-x11
Description: ChonkOS Arctic Wayland desktop environment (Sway + Waybar + Foot)
 Flat slate-blue and cyan Wayland desktop assembled from segmented
 configuration layers: Sway compositor, Waybar status bar, Foot terminal,
 Fuzzel launcher and Mako notifications, with tuigreet as the greeter.
